{"seq":2,"slug":"rmarkdown-quarto","title":"R Markdown 与 Quarto 报告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/rmarkdown-quarto","wordCount":767,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"r-markdown-与-quarto-报告\">R Markdown 与 Quarto 报告</h1><p>可复现研究的核心承诺是：代码、数据和叙述共存于同一文档中，任何人在任何时刻重新运行都能获得相同结果。R Markdown 自 2012 年起实现了这个承诺，而 Quarto（2022 年由 Posit 发布）是其架构重写——多语言支持、统一配置、内置项目类型（网站/书籍/博客）、以及脱离 R 依赖的独立 CLI。2026 年的共识是：新项目用 Quarto，既有 R Markdown 文档继续正常工作无需迁移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>可复现研究的承诺是代码、数据与叙述共存于同一文档</strong>，重跑即得相同结果。</li>\n<li><strong>Quarto 是架构重写而非增量升级</strong>：多语言支持、YAML 统一配置、内置项目类型，并有独立于 R 的 CLI。</li>\n<li><strong><code>#|</code> 选项取代 chunk 行内选项</strong>：Quarto 用 YAML 式块选项统一了 R Markdown 中分散的 chunk 配置。</li>\n<li><strong>交叉引用是 Quarto 的原生能力</strong>：图、表、方程都可以用 <code>@label</code> 引用，无需 bookdown 之类的外部包。</li>\n<li><strong>一次书写多格式输出</strong>：同一 <code>.qmd</code> 经 knitr 与 Pandoc 渲染为 HTML/PDF/Word/演示等形态。</li>\n<li><strong>参数化报告让同一模板服务多个切片</strong>：按区域、时间或实验组批量生成，配合 <code>purrr::walk()</code> 自动化。</li>\n<li><strong>项目类型决定输出结构</strong>：website/book/dashboard 各有自己的 <code>_quarto.yml</code> 配置约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"quarto-vs-r-markdown-决策\">Quarto vs R Markdown 决策</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>R Markdown (.Rmd)</th>\n<th>Quarto (.qmd)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言支持</td>\n<td>以 R 为中心</td>\n<td>R / Python / Julia / Observable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置方式</td>\n<td>setup chunk + 分散选项</td>\n<td>YAML 统一配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出格式</td>\n<td>需额外包（bookdown/blogdown）</td>\n<td>内置网站/书籍/演示/博客</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉引用</td>\n<td>包依赖（bookdown）</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IDE 支持</td>\n<td>RStudio</td>\n<td>RStudio + VS Code + Jupyter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLI</td>\n<td>无（依赖 rmarkdown 包）</td>\n<td><code>quarto render/preview/publish</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护状态</td>\n<td>维护模式（bug fix only）</td>\n<td>活跃开发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"quarto-文档结构\">Quarto 文档结构</h2><h3 id=\"基础文档\">基础文档</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"---&#10;title: &#39;临床试验中期分析报告&#39;&#10;author: &#39;统计团队&#39;&#10;date: today&#10;format:&#10;  html:&#10;    toc: true&#10;    code-fold: true&#10;    theme: cosmo&#10;  pdf:&#10;    documentclass: article&#10;    fontsize: 11pt&#10;execute:&#10;  echo: false&#10;  warning: false&#10;---\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'临床试验中期分析报告'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">author</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'统计团队'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">today</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  html</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    toc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    code-fold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    theme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cosmo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    documentclass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">article</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    fontsize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">11pt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  warning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span></code></pre></div><p>代码块使用 <code>{r}</code> 或 <code>{python}</code>，选项通过 <code>#|</code> 注释指定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"#| label: fig-survival&#10;#| fig-cap: &quot;Kaplan-Meier 生存曲线&quot;&#10;#| fig-width: 8&#10;#| fig-height: 5&#10;&#10;library(survival)&#10;library(survminer)&#10;&#10;km_fit &lt;- survfit(Surv(time, status) ~ treatment, data = trial_data)&#10;ggsurvplot(km_fit, data = trial_data, pval = TRUE)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#| label: fig-survival</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#| fig-cap: \"Kaplan-Meier 生存曲线\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#| fig-width: 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#| fig-height: 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(survival)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(survminer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>km_fit &#x3C;- survfit(Surv(time, status) ~ treatment, data = trial_data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggsurvplot(km_fit, data = trial_data, pval = TRUE)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"交叉引用\">交叉引用</h3><p>Quarto 原生支持图表、表格和方程的交叉引用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"见 @fig-survival 展示的生存曲线。&#10;&#10;模型系数见 @tbl-coefficients。&#10;&#10;根据 @eq-hazard 所定义的风险函数...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">见 @fig-survival 展示的生存曲线。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">模型系数见 @tbl-coefficients。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">根据 @eq-hazard 所定义的风险函数...</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"#| label: tbl-coefficients&#10;#| tbl-cap: &quot;Cox 模型系数&quot;&#10;&#10;cox_fit |&gt; broom::tidy(conf.int = TRUE) |&gt; knitr::kable(digits = 3)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#| label: tbl-coefficients</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#| tbl-cap: \"Cox 模型系数\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cox_fit |> broom::tidy(conf.int = TRUE) |> knitr::kable(digits = 3)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数学方程的引用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"$$&#10;h(t|\\mathbf{x}) = h_0(t) \\exp(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}^T \\mathbf{x})&#10;$$ {#eq-hazard}&#10;$$\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h(t|\\mathbf{x}) = h_0(t) \\exp(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}^T \\mathbf{x})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$ {#eq-hazard}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多格式输出\">多格式输出</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[.qmd 源文件] --&gt; B[Knitr 引擎]&#10;    B --&gt; C[.md 中间文件]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Pandoc]&#10;    D --&gt; E[HTML]&#10;    D --&gt; F[PDF via LaTeX]&#10;    D --&gt; G[Word .docx]&#10;    D --&gt; H[RevealJS 演示]&#10;    D --&gt; I[Typst PDF]\">graph TD\n    A[.qmd 源文件] --&gt; B[Knitr 引擎]\n    B --&gt; C[.md 中间文件]\n    C --&gt; D[Pandoc]\n    D --&gt; E[HTML]\n    D --&gt; F[PDF via LaTeX]\n    D --&gt; G[Word .docx]\n    D --&gt; H[RevealJS 演示]\n    D --&gt; I[Typst PDF]</pre><h3 id=\"html-报告\">HTML 报告</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"format:&#10;  html:&#10;    toc: true&#10;    toc-depth: 3&#10;    number-sections: true&#10;    code-fold: true # 代码默认折叠&#10;    code-summary: &#39;查看代码&#39;&#10;    self-contained: true # 单文件输出&#10;    theme:&#10;      light: flatly&#10;      dark: darkly\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  html</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    toc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    toc-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    number-sections</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    code-fold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 代码默认折叠</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    code-summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'查看代码'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    self-contained</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 单文件输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    theme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      light</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flatly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      dark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">darkly</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"pdf-报告-学术论文\">PDF 报告（学术论文）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"format:&#10;  pdf:&#10;    documentclass: article&#10;    papersize: a4&#10;    geometry:&#10;      - margin=2.5cm&#10;    fontfamily: libertinus&#10;    cite-method: biblatex&#10;    bibliography: references.bib\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    documentclass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">article</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    papersize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">a4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    geometry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">margin=2.5cm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    fontfamily</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">libertinus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cite-method</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">biblatex</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    bibliography</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">references.bib</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"typst-轻量-pdf-替代\">Typst（轻量 PDF 替代）</h3><p>Quarto 1.4 引入 Typst 支持——比 LaTeX 更快的排版引擎：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"format:&#10;  typst:&#10;    toc: true&#10;    columns: 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  typst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    toc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"参数化报告\">参数化报告</h2><p>参数化报告允许同一模板生成不同版本——按区域、按时间段、按实验组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"---&#10;title: &#39;季度报告&#39;&#10;params:&#10;  region: &#39;华东&#39;&#10;  quarter: &#39;2026Q2&#39;&#10;  start_date: &#39;2026-04-01&#39;&#10;  end_date: &#39;2026-06-30&#39;&#10;---\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'季度报告'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  region</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'华东'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  quarter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026Q2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  start_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-04-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  end_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-06-30'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"c